@prefix gmeow:  <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix skos:   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix semapv: <https://w3id.org/semapv/vocab/> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix foaf:   <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/> .
@prefix wd:     <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/> .
@prefix sumo:   <https://www.ontologyportal.org/SUMO.owl#> .
@prefix cyc:    <http://sw.opencyc.org/2012/05/10/concept/en/> .
@prefix esco-base: <http://data.europa.eu/esco/> .
@prefix ctdlasn: <https://credreg.net/ctdlasn/terms/> .
@prefix onet:   <https://www.onetcenter.org/> .

# Term equivalences for the cognition domain — GMEOW authoring source.
# Compiled to mappings/gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv by `gmeow compile-mappings`.
# Wikidata QIDs verified by entity-page curl 2026-06-18: Q9081 (knowledge),
# Q6501338 (attention), Q366791 (curiosity), Q12770764 (mastery) retained;
# issue-supplied Q327954 (torch), Q179637 (prisoner of war) and Q1016098
# (Mautes) rejected.

gmeow:mapsetCognition a gmeow:MappingSet ;
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:setId "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mappings/cognition" ;
    gmeow:license "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" ;
    gmeow:setComment "Cognition alignments — the knowledge spectrum and its reified tier. schema.org offers a single flat knowsAbout; GMEOW's four-level spectrum down-collapses to it (lossy), and a bare schema:knowsAbout lifts to the eponymous gmeow:knowsAbout level (its honest floor — depth is never inferred from a flat edge). The reified gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency reads its depth on a gmeow:ProficiencyScale: the native gmeow:scaleKnowledgeDepth (the four gmeow:KnowledgeLevel ordinals) is the default, while Bloom's revised taxonomy (gmeow:scaleBloomRevised), SOLO (gmeow:scaleSOLO), and Dreyfus (gmeow:scaleDreyfus, expertise) are reusable alternates — NO canonical framework is enforced (Principle 6). The cross-framework band correspondence is the documented alignment ledger in docs.md, never an OWL axiom (cognition ⊥ expertise; the knows-axis and the can-do axis are never silently bridged, Principle 9). Additional relatedMatch anchors: FOAF interest/focus for motivational/attentional relations; Wikidata QIDs for knowledge, attention, curiosity and mastery; SUMO knows and OpenCyc knowsAbout for objectual knowing concepts; ESCO, CTDL/ASN and O*NET competency-framework namespaces for the knowledge-depth axis." .

# schema:knowsAbout IS the gmeow:knowsAbout level of the spectrum: an agent has
# knowledge of a subject. exactMatch (not closeMatch) so a source schema:knowsAbout
# lifts to an ASSERTED gmeow:knowsAbout fact (the QID-anchored subject preserved),
# outranking the narrower gmeow:hasSkill→schema:knowsAbout projection collision.
gmeow:knowsAbout skos:exactMatch schema:knowsAbout {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.95 ;
    gmeow:comment "schema:knowsAbout — an agent's knowledge of a subject — is exactly the gmeow:knowsAbout level of the four-level knowledge spectrum; the finer levels (understands, hasMastered) are GMEOW enrichment that down-collapses to this flat target."
|} .

# FOAF — interest. closeMatch: foaf:interest points at a page about a topic of
# interest, while gmeow:interestedIn points at the subject itself, so the match
# is close but not exact.
gmeow:interestedIn skos:closeMatch foaf:interest {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.8 ;
    gmeow:comment "foaf:interest is a page about a topic of interest to the agent; gmeow:interestedIn links the agent directly to the subject. CloseMatch only — the indirection through a page is lossy."
|} .

# FOAF — focus. closeMatch used as requested, but the semantics are a stretch:
# foaf:focus relates a SKOS concept to its real-world focal entity, not to
# momentary attention. Documented as the honest floor.
gmeow:attendsTo skos:closeMatch foaf:focus {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.7 ;
    gmeow:comment "foaf:focus maps a SKOS concept to its underlying focal entity; gmeow:attendsTo is an agent's momentary attention toward a subject. closeMatch is directional and lossy — attention is broader and agent-centred."
|} .

# Native knowledge-depth scale → Bloom's revised taxonomy. Band-level relatedMatch:
# both taxonomies order cognitive depth, but the rungs do not correspond one-to-one.
gmeow:scaleKnowledgeDepth skos:relatedMatch wd:Q1774565 {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.65 ;
    gmeow:comment "Wikidata Q1774565 'Bloom Taxonomy' — band-level relatedMatch to the native knowledge-depth scale. Anderson & Krathwohl's revised Bloom's taxonomy is the intended framework; no crisp rung-to-rung equivalence is asserted."
|} .

# Native knowledge-depth scale → SOLO taxonomy. No single stable RDF concept IRI
# exists; the canonical Wikipedia article is used as a namespace-level target.
gmeow:scaleKnowledgeDepth skos:relatedMatch <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Structure_of_observed_learning_outcome> {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.65 ;
    gmeow:comment "SOLO taxonomy (Biggs & Collis) — band-level relatedMatch to the native knowledge-depth scale. No stable RDF vocabulary namespace exists, so the Wikipedia article is used as the canonical reference target."
|} .

# Native knowledge-depth scale → Dreyfus model of skill acquisition.
gmeow:scaleKnowledgeDepth skos:relatedMatch wd:Q5307365 {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.65 ;
    gmeow:comment "Wikidata Q5307365 'Dreyfus model of skill acquisition' — band-level relatedMatch to the native knowledge-depth scale. Dreyfus stages are about skill proficiency, not objectual knowledge, so the alignment is loose and by reference only."
|} .

# Native knowledge-depth scale → ESCO competency-framework namespace.
gmeow:scaleKnowledgeDepth skos:relatedMatch <http://data.europa.eu/esco/> {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.65 ;
    gmeow:comment "ESCO (European Skills, Competences, Qualifications and Occupations) namespace — band-level relatedMatch. ESCO organises knowledge, skills and competences; no single term corresponds to the whole GMEOW depth axis."
|} .

# Native knowledge-depth scale → CTDL/ASN competency-framework namespace.
gmeow:scaleKnowledgeDepth skos:relatedMatch <https://credreg.net/ctdlasn/terms/> {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.65 ;
    gmeow:comment "CTDL/ASN (Credential Transparency Description Language / Achievement Standards Network) namespace — band-level relatedMatch. The framework describes competency frameworks and statements; the correspondence to GMEOW's depth axis is loose."
|} .

# Native knowledge-depth scale → O*NET competency-framework namespace.
gmeow:scaleKnowledgeDepth skos:relatedMatch <https://www.onetcenter.org/> {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.65 ;
    gmeow:comment "O*NET (Occupational Information Network) namespace — band-level relatedMatch. O*NET's Knowledge content-model area is conceptually adjacent to the GMEOW knowledge-depth axis, but no single term gives a crisp alignment."
|} .

# SUMO / CYC — objectual knowing concepts. SUMO knows is propositional; GMEOW
# isAwareOf / knowsAbout are objectual, so the match is relatedMatch only.
# CYC has no stable, resolvable RDF namespace and is referenced in prose only.
gmeow:isAwareOf skos:relatedMatch sumo:knows {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.6 ;
    gmeow:comment "SUMO knows is propositional (agent knows a formula); gmeow:isAwareOf is objectual (agent is aware of a subject). relatedMatch only. CYC objectual knows concepts are conceptually adjacent but have no stable resolvable RDF namespace and are referenced in prose."
|} .

gmeow:knowsAbout skos:relatedMatch sumo:knows {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.6 ;
    gmeow:comment "SUMO knows is propositional; gmeow:knowsAbout is objectual familiarity with a subject. relatedMatch only. CYC objectual knows concepts are conceptually adjacent but have no stable resolvable RDF namespace and are referenced in prose."
|} .

# Wikidata — knowledge.
gmeow:knowsAbout skos:relatedMatch wd:Q9081 {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.7 ;
    gmeow:comment "Wikidata Q9081 'knowledge' — entity-page verified 2026-06-18. relatedMatch: Q9081 is the general concept, while gmeow:knowsAbout is a specific epistemic relation."
|} .

# Wikidata — attention.
gmeow:attendsTo skos:relatedMatch wd:Q6501338 {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.7 ;
    gmeow:comment "Wikidata Q6501338 'attention' — entity-page verified 2026-06-18. Issue-supplied Q327954 resolved to 'torch' and was rejected."
|} .

# Wikidata — curiosity.
gmeow:curiousAbout skos:relatedMatch wd:Q366791 {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.7 ;
    gmeow:comment "Wikidata Q366791 'curiosity' — entity-page verified 2026-06-18. Issue-supplied Q179637 resolved to 'prisoner of war' and was rejected."
|} .

# Wikidata — mastery.
gmeow:hasMastered skos:relatedMatch wd:Q12770764 {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.7 ;
    gmeow:comment "Wikidata Q12770764 'mastery' — entity-page verified 2026-06-18. Issue-supplied Q1016098 resolved to 'Mautes' (French commune) and was rejected."
|} .

# OpenCyc — objectual knowing-about. CYC knowsAbout relates an IntelligentAgent to
# a THING (not a proposition), so it aligns with GMEOW's objectual gmeow:knowsAbout.
# The 2012-05-10 readable OpenCyc IRI is used; live resolution depends on the
# OpenCyc semantic-web endpoint, which has been intermittent (stability caveat).
gmeow:knowsAbout skos:relatedMatch cyc:knowsAbout {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-cognition.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.6 ;
    gmeow:comment "OpenCyc knowsAbout (http://sw.opencyc.org/2012/05/10/concept/en/knowsAbout) — an IntelligentAgent knows something about a THING; objectual, not propositional. relatedMatch to gmeow:knowsAbout only. OpenCyc endpoint stability is a known caveat."
|} .
